    "detailed_description": "Avoo is a trivia game for 1-4 players in which players collaborate to repopulate a forest by watering it with their knowledge.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Test your knowledge: More than a thousand questions about culture, cinema, history, mathematics, literature and other categories.<br></li><li>Water the seed of knowledge: Each correct answer allows you to water the trees and repopulate the forest.<br></li><li>Go through the seasons: Play in 5 different maps and answer the questions correctly to repopulate the forest.<br></li><li>Up to 4 players: Play alone or with up to 4 players.</li></ul>",
